## How Flash Cards work
// The Flash Cards example is a deck of Spanish words to learn:
// the word on the front, what it means on the back.  Click the card to turn it over.
// Two ideas do the work:
// - a card knows which side is up, and draws only that side
// - the quiz deals the next card at random from the deck
//
// This guide keeps those two, and leaves out the score.  Open Flash Cards, in the Examples, for the whole quiz.


## A card:  a word on the front, what it means on the back
a "flash card" is a view where:
	- its "front" is text
	- its "back" is text
	// which side is up:  "one of" lists every value it can have, and it can't be anything else
	- its "side" is one of front or back
	- it "is turned over" if its side is back

	- to turn it over:
		set its side to back if its side is front otherwise front

	// one side at a time:  a click turns it over
	- to draw it:
		return <div part="card" onClick={turn it over}>
			{its back if it is turned over otherwise its front}
		</div>

// the cards to learn
a "deck" is a list of flash cards


## The quiz:  the deck, and the card showing
quiz is an app where:
	- its "deck" is a new deck
	- its "card" is a flash card

	// a card at random, front up:  never the one showing now
	- to deal a card:
		set others to cards in its deck where it is not the card of quiz
		set its card to a random card in others
		set the side of its card to front

	- to draw it:
		return <div class="Quiz">
			{draw its card}
			<ui-button primary onClick={deal a card}>Next card</ui-button>
		</div>


## The deck:  four words to start -- add your own
to add (word as text) meaning (translation as text):
	add (a new flash card with front = word, back = translation, side = front) to the deck of quiz

add "el gato" meaning "the cat"
add "el perro" meaning "the dog"
add "la casa" meaning "the house"
add "el libro" meaning "the book"


## Start
deal a card
start quiz


## A check
to test turning a card over
	set the card to a new flash card with front = "el gato", back = "the cat", side = front
	the card is turned over should be no
	turn the card over
	the card is turned over should be yes


## Try it
